-> Test: link a native .so module with alias and access its exports.
link native_modules/libtest_math.so as math

-> Test exported variable
assert math.PI > 3.14
assert math.PI < 3.15

-> Test type declaration + handler dispatch
emit math.Point { x = 2, y = 3 } to math get result
assert result.x = 2
assert result.y = 3
assert result.sum = 5
